  "pack_markdown": "# Rumor Market — Interaction Wireframe Pack v0.3\n\nPortrait whole-MVP pack covering all 9 inventory screens and 7 states. Fun promise: 한 사람에게 흘린 소문의 결정론적 관계망 파장을 예측하고, 때로 한 번 뒤집히는 정보가 가격·행동·관계를 바꾸는 결과를 이용하는 재미.\n\nCore UX exposes topology and acceptance inputs before the single daily seed, then renders deterministic propagation in causal order. Early sparse and later dense/rival scenarios reuse the same rules. Implementation architecture is intentionally deferred to Implementation Blueprint.",
